{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27446","headline":"车遥遥 · 张祜","name":"车遥遥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方曨曨车轧轧，地色不分新去辙。\n闺门半掩窗半空，斑斑枕花残泪红。\n君心若车千万转，妾身如辙遗渐远。\n碧川迢迢山宛宛，马蹄在耳轮在眼。\n桑间女儿情不浅，莫道野蚕能作茧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}